SUMMARY:Panigiri of Panagia Lymbiani and Panagia Spiliotissa (8 September)
LOCATION:Achilli\, Skyros\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The Nativity of the Virgin is kept on 7-8 September at Panagia Lymbiani and on the 8th at the cave chapel of Panagia Spiliotissa above Achilli bay south of the Chora\, with tavles after the liturgy. Good late-season option: warm sea\, empty beaches and the last violins of the year.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/skyros/#achilli-panigiri-of-panagia-lymbiani-and-panagia-spiliotissa
